Open Vanilla 0037: the Duels queue for real people. Two players on one network (a household, a test from one
computer) used to never meet in the rated queue (Arena.SameAddressRated=0 keeps boosting off the ladder): on
Duels they now get their fight, unrated ("match unrated: both sides on one network"). A 1v1 is always just
you, in a party or not; 2v2 and 3v3 are a party of exactly that size, queued by its leader
("err,partysize,<n>" otherwise).

diff --git a/src/game/OpenVanilla/WarfrontArena.cpp b/src/game/OpenVanilla/WarfrontArena.cpp
index ce11304f2..06acce9d0 100644
--- a/src/game/OpenVanilla/WarfrontArena.cpp
+++ b/src/game/OpenVanilla/WarfrontArena.cpp
